  "question": "A web page has become slow to load. In what order would you look for the cause, and what does each check tell you?",
  "model_answer": "A sensible order: first check whether it is slow for everyone or one user, then the browser network panel to see which request is slow, then the server side for slow queries or heavy work, then the database (missing indexes, large result sets), then caching, then recent changes. Measure before changing anything and change one thing at a time.",
