  "question": "Coding B — Longest run",
  "model_answer": "Walk the list once while keeping the length of the current run: if this value equals the previous one the run grows, otherwise it restarts at 1. Keep the largest run seen. Return 0 for an empty list. One pass, constant extra memory.",
  "key_points": [
